cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CLOVER: Course Learning-Outcome Validation, Evaluation and Reporting"
message: "If CLOVER contributes to published work, please cite the SoftwareX article below."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SHELLY000/Clover"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible, auditable and self-checking course-outcome attainment
  assessment for outcome-based education. Expresses the item-to-objective-to-
  indicator mapping as a versioned, hashed blueprint; computes attainment with
  bootstrap intervals; and applies ten validity checks that determine whether
  each reported value is identifiable from the evidence declared.
keywords:
  - outcome-based education
  - learning outcome attainment
  - educational measurement
  - identifiability
  - accreditation
  - reproducibility
authors:
